  "notes": [
    "Reflexive form of *producir* (to produce); used to mean \"to occur / to happen / to take place\"",
    "Most commonly used in 3rd person: *se produce un accidente* (an accident occurs)",
    "Irregular yo present: *me produzco* (c→zc change, like *conocer*, *conducir*)",
    "Irregular preterite stem: *produj-* (like *conducir* → *conduj-*); no accent on 3rd person singular (*produjo*)",
    "Past participle: *producido*",
    "Subjuntivo stem from yo form: *produzc-* (*se produzca*)"
